# Demo Rule — Always Apply (Static + Simple)

This repo is a live demo, not a production app.

## Constraints to enforce
- Use plain HTML/CSS/vanilla JS only (no frameworks, no build step).
- Everything must work by opening index.html locally.
- Prefer clarity over cleverness: explicit names, short functions, readable code.
- Avoid extra engineering: no backend, no bundlers, no dependencies, no external services.

## Communication style
- Assume the audience is not frontend-focused.
- Explain decisions briefly and avoid jargon when possible.
